  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction and Equipping of a New 300-Bed Specialized Hospital in Kaduna State (Commodity Murabaha)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to provide comprehensive and qualitative tertiary health care services that effectively handle referrals from primary and secondary health facilities inside Nigeria and from neighboring countries. The scope includes civil works, consultancy services for civil works, medical and non-medical equipment, consultancy services for medical and non- medical equipment and Support to Project Implementation (i.e. PMU, start -up workshop, familiarization visit, and financial audit).</narrative>
  </description>
